# The dev, rolling, main ladder (docs/guide/concepts-ladder.md).
title: Every change climbs the same ladder: dev, then rolling, then main
direction: down
pr: A story's pull request
dev: dev: where every merge lands
rolling: rolling: canary snapshot, tag rolling-date
main: main: stable release, tag vX.Y.Z
pr -> dev: green gate, squash-merge
dev -> rolling: rolling gate passes
rolling -> main: stable gate passes
